  "input": "task: semantic similarity between historical scouting games\noriginal-language: pl\noriginal-title: Obraz nielogiczny\noriginal-context: Obrazek np. obozu, gdzie namioty stoją bez kozłów, cienie drzew — w różne strony, bandera odwrotnie zawieszona; lub obraz ulicy, zima — a chodzą ludzie w letnich ubraniach, zielone drzewa — a jest ślizgawka i t. p. Trzeba zauważyć te „bezsensy”.\nparallel-language: en\nparallel-title: Illogical Picture\nparallel-context: A picture, for example, of a camp where tents stand without trestles, tree shadows point in different directions, a flag is hung upside down; or a picture of a street in winter—yet people are walking in summer clothes, trees are green—but there is an ice rink, and so on. One must notice these \"nonsenses.\"",
